---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import VideoEmbed from '../../components/VideoEmbed.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Delivering a Brand Campaign, Solo"
  company="Zolostays"
  role="Creative Producer · Contract"
  duration="2020 – 2021"
  heroTagline="Built the Zolo Got Talent campaign from scratch in 6 months as a solo creative contractor. Worked with the core marketing team to produce participant videos, semi-final qualifiers, and guest appearance content."
  accentColor="#F59E0B"
>

  <!-- SECTION 1 -- THE PROBLEM -->
  <section class="cs-section">
    <span class="cs-section__label">The Problem</span>
    <h2 class="cs-section__heading">A brand campaign with no creative team</h2>
    <p>
      Zolostays needed a full brand campaign for Zolo Got Talent, a pan-India contest engaging residents across their properties. There was no internal creative team, no existing campaign assets, and no template to start from. Just a brief and a deadline.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2 -- THE APPROACH -->
  <section class="cs-section">
    <span class="cs-section__label">The Approach</span>
    <h2 class="cs-section__heading">Owned the pipeline, end to end</h2>
    <p>
      Worked directly with Zolo's core marketing team to build the campaign visual language. Produced participant introduction videos, semi-finalist qualifier reels, and guest appearance content. Each piece followed the same visual system: bold typography, star particle effects, and high-energy pacing.
    </p>
    <p>
      No handoff required. I shot, designed, animated, sound designed, and delivered every asset. The volume of content across contestants, qualifiers, and event promos demanded consistent creative output without a production team behind me.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Pull Quote -->
  <div class="cs-highlight">
    <p>
      Six months, one person, end to end. From concept to final export, the entire campaign was built by a single creative lead.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- THE WORK -->
  <section class="cs-section">
    <span class="cs-section__label">The Work</span>
    <h2 class="cs-section__heading">Campaign content</h2>
    <p>
      Selected content from the Zolo Got Talent campaign, showing the visual system developed for participant promos, qualifiers, and event teasers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="cs-video-grid">
    <VideoEmbed videoId="r2CSJeCxBQU" caption="ZGT Teaser. Event intro with particle effects and kinetic typography." />
    <VideoEmbed videoId="98XQhJitd1c" caption="ZGT Promo. Contestant montage with video wall and star animations." />
  </div>

  <!-- MY ROLE -->
  <section class="cs-section">
    <span class="cs-section__label">My Role</span>
    <h2 class="cs-section__heading">Solo creative producer</h2>
    <p>
      Concept, script, storyboard, motion design, sound design, and delivery. All me. Worked alongside the marketing team for strategy and direction. Every decision had to be right the first time with no fallback team.
    </p>
  </section>

</CaseStudyLayout>

<style is:global>
  .cs-video-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
</style>
